@startuml fig-2-3-ssd-analyse-page
' Figure 2.3 — System sequence diagram, UC-01 Analyse Visited Page
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Browser\nNavigation Event" as Browser
participant ":System" as System
participant ":VirusTotal" as VT <<external>>

Browser -> System : pageNavigationStarted(tabId, url)
activate System
System --> Browser : signalCollectionArmed
deactivate System

Browser -> System : resourceRequestCompleted(tabId, requestUrl)
note right : Repeated once per sub-resource\nover the lifetime of the page load

Browser -> System : topLevelRedirect(tabId)
note right : Repeated per redirect hop

Browser -> System : pageLoadComplete(tabId, url)
activate System

System -> VT : getDomainReputation(registrableDomain)
activate VT
VT --> System : reputation { ageDays, maliciousVotes, harmlessVotes }
deactivate VT

System --> Browser : analysisResult { scanId, verdict, riskPct,\nconfidencePct, topReasons, flaggedRules }
deactivate System

note over System
  Alternative flow 4a: VirusTotal times out after 5 s.
  The system substitutes sentinel values and proceeds;
  the verdict is unchanged.

  Alternative flow 5a: the trained model is unavailable.
  The system returns HTTP 503 rather than a fabricated
  verdict (ADR-016).
end note
@enduml
